    <span>Windows 365</span>
  </div>

  <!-- Hero -->
  <div class="hero">
    <h1>Windows technical documentation for developers and IT pros.</h1>
    <p>Information for Windows application developers, hardware developers, and IT pros.</p>
  </div>

  <!-- Cards -->
  <div class="cards-wrapper">
    <div class="cards-grid">
      <div class="card">
        <div class="icon">&#128187;</div>
        <h3>Application developers</h3>
        <p>Design, develop, and deploy applications and other solutions for Windows PCs and other devices.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="card">
        <div class="icon">&#128295;</div>
        <h3>Developer tools</h3>
        <p>No matter what you're building, Windows is optimized for developers.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="card">
        <div class="icon">&#9881;</div>
        <h3>Hardware developers</h3>
        <p>Design, develop, and deploy hardware and device drivers for Windows PCs and other devices.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="card">
        <div class="icon">&#128421;</div>
        <h3>Windows client for IT pros</h3>
        <p>Evaluate, plan, deploy, secure, and manage devices running Windows 10 and Windows 11.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="card">
        <div class="icon">&#128421;</div>
        <h3>Windows Server for IT pros</h3>
        <p>Build and deploy connected applications, networks, and web services on Windows Server.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="card">
        <div class="icon">&#128279;</div>
        <h3>Windows for IoT</h3>
        <p>Create IoT solutions with secure devices that can be quickly provisioned, easily managed, and seamlessly connected to an overall cloud strategy.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="card">
        <div class="icon">&#128101;</div>
        <h3>Windows Insider Program</h3>
        <p>Be the first to see what's next and help shape Windows' future by running Windows Insider Preview builds and giving feedback.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="card">
        <div class="icon">&#9744;</div>
        <h3>Windows 365</h3>
        <p>Official product documentation for Windows 365.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- Footer -->
  <div class="footer">
    <div class="footer-top">
      <span>&#127760; English (United States)</span>
